  "sourceCorrections": [
    {
      "sourceExampleRecordId": "notes-source-example-000156",
      "sourcePath": "miniprogram/models/note-logic/points/definition.json",
      "jsonPointer": "/1/tabs/1/blocks/0",
      "pointId": "definition-elimination",
      "tabId": "example",
      "blockIndex": 0,
      "beforeBlockSha256": "0143e0b3992785a98a4128d3dd123dfa1210e29e8827b7dc50a0754d29d10019",
      "afterBlockSha256": "13642e434a515b4edef725aef5d45f60e5f6d4a952ec7ce2df68e68a6faf9f6e",
      "beforeAnalysis": "A、B、C 都是面对压力/危险时的生理反应，结构相似，属于同构选项。D 是正常生理反应，不属于应激反应。问‘不属于’时，同构选项通常都属于，排除后选 D。",
      "afterAnalysis": "题干没有给出“应激反应”的定义，不能只凭常识或选项结构判定 D。定义判断必须先取得完整定义，再逐项核对对象、条件和结果；选项相似只能帮助定位，不能代替定义。",
      "stemChanged": false,
      "optionsChanged": false,
      "answerChanged": false,
      "correctionKind": "analysis-only"
    },
    {
      "sourceExampleRecordId": "notes-source-example-000171",
      "sourcePath": "miniprogram/models/note-logic/points/formal.json",
      "jsonPointer": "/7/tabs/1/blocks/0",
      "pointId": "truth-tactics",
      "tabId": "example",
      "blockIndex": 0,
      "beforeBlockSha256": "3c9d22e68c6944c584f71cc268cb14e7c8265b9494a5766d824d36b0b784e61d",
      "afterBlockSha256": "afdfdef4fbe9164893484f80253339480fe9cd706a5c0855e7b2a75d17e1733e",
      "beforeAnalysis": "两个所有：找点名那句，顺着说，人称变所有。利用矛盾关系定位突破口。",
      "afterAnalysis": "“所有人都是好人”和“所有人都是坏人”本身不是矛盾命题对。即使规定坏人就是非好人，两句话也可能同时为假；“所有人都是好人”的真正否定是“有些人不是好人”。题干若另给仅一真、点名句等条件，可以继续判断真假，但不能据此把这两个全称命题直接称为矛盾。",
      "stemChanged": false,
      "optionsChanged": false,
      "answerChanged": false,
      "correctionKind": "analysis-only"
    },
    {
      "sourceExampleRecordId": "notes-source-example-000177",
      "sourcePath": "miniprogram/models/note-logic/points/quick-kill.json",
      "jsonPointer": "/1/tabs/1/blocks/0",
      "pointId": "quick-truth-one-real",
      "tabId": "example",
      "blockIndex": 0,
      "beforeBlockSha256": "601f95729750c69b80103350df6335daad37ff22a107cea9cce521f07212e424",
      "afterBlockSha256": "f3aa7cefafea91762c92b4e585a31f39bf340eaeb99aa3a912b0ed4f2ffe305d",
      "beforeAnalysis": "先找到“会计师”。若假设乙为会计师，则丙会成为会计师，矛盾，所以乙的预言为假；继续推出丙、丁的预言也为假，最终只剩甲为会计师。",
      "afterAnalysis": "当前题干没有列出四人的具体身份选项和预言内容，无法推出谁是会计师。“只有会计师的预言正确”只给出身份与真话的关系；须补齐每人的预言后，再逐句检验。",
      "stemChanged": false,
      "optionsChanged": false,
      "answerChanged": false,
      "correctionKind": "analysis-only"
    },
    {
      "sourceExampleRecordId": "notes-source-example-000178",
      "sourcePath": "miniprogram/models/note-logic/points/quick-kill.json",
      "jsonPointer": "/1/tabs/1/blocks/1",
      "pointId": "quick-truth-one-real",
      "tabId": "example",
      "blockIndex": 1,
      "beforeBlockSha256": "3dad0a9a8fc4fbfa3dc95c9eebe89b98626088fea2c0f35bbb42b31d1a08d36f",
      "afterBlockSha256": "94d9d05ba6038dbcbc2c5512239b75fb4d7ef43c3baf8fbaa292d9c6d35cbd45",
      "beforeAnalysis": "乙的话和丁的话互为矛盾，必有一真一假。绕开矛盾，甲、丙均为假：甲说“乙吃”为假，丙说“我没吃”为假，所以丙吃了。回到矛盾可知丁说真话。",
      "afterAnalysis": "乙的话“丁吃了”和丁的话“乙在撒谎”（即丁没吃）互为矛盾，必有一真一假。因为全题只有一人说真话，甲、丙的话都为假，可确定乙没吃、丙吃了；但题干没有说明只有一人吃，不能继续判断丁是否吃，也就不能确定乙、丁中谁说真话。若另有“只有一人吃”的条件，才可进一步推出丁没吃、丁说真话。",
      "stemChanged": false,
      "optionsChanged": false,
      "answerChanged": false,
      "correctionKind": "analysis-only"
    },
    {
      "sourceExampleRecordId": "notes-source-example-000183",
      "sourcePath": "miniprogram/models/note-logic/points/quick-kill.json",
      "jsonPointer": "/4/tabs/1/blocks/0",
      "pointId": "quick-size-comparison",
      "tabId": "example",
      "blockIndex": 0,
      "beforeBlockSha256": "23f32a6cbdb8a62756f06c4ba2f52046d6792222cf64853d2e743ab8edfebc61",
      "afterBlockSha256": "42300086ee504f0437bbe76024ea079e914e4f289abc81661571499dcd1ea3d4",
      "beforeAnalysis": "最大信息是“通州”。把通州放中间：小红与通州不同龄，通州比小兰大，朝阳比小慧大。代入排除后，可得住朝阳区的是小慧。",
      "afterAnalysis": "先看出现两次的“通州”：小红与住通州者年龄不同，所以小红不住通州；住通州者比小兰年龄大，所以小兰也不住通州，因此小慧住通州。再由小慧比住朝阳者年龄小、住通州的小慧比小兰年龄大，可知朝阳者不是小慧或小兰，只能是小红；小兰住丰台。",
      "stemChanged": false,
      "optionsChanged": false,
      "answerChanged": false,
      "correctionKind": "analysis-only"
    },
    {
      "sourceExampleRecordId": "notes-source-example-000184",
      "sourcePath": "miniprogram/models/note-logic/points/quick-kill.json",
      "jsonPointer": "/4/tabs/1/blocks/1",
      "pointId": "quick-size-comparison",
      "tabId": "example",
      "blockIndex": 1,
      "beforeBlockSha256": "5d459f9bb0ee9a87404baca1f37915dce2f647b3c4598dd167ab3d42ce82a2de",
      "afterBlockSha256": "979441674216eeb199a901df4ec74390ed67de93fb0ecca7743d19848c9643f1",
      "beforeAnalysis": "拆成学历和性别两部分：本科 > 研究生，女性 > 男性。两个维度都更大，所以本科女性 > 研究生男性，符合“大大则大”。",
      "afterAnalysis": "若题干明确同一总体的学历只分本科、研究生，性别只分女性、男性，设本科女、研究生男分别为 a、d，则“本科 > 研究生”和“女性 > 男性”两式相加可得 2a > 2d，即本科女 > 研究生男。当前题干没有说明这两组分类互斥且穷尽，因此条件不足，不能直接断定大小。",
      "stemChanged": false,
      "optionsChanged": false,
      "answerChanged": false,
      "correctionKind": "analysis-only"
    }
  ],
